 "stimulus_html": "Use the figure to answer the following exercises.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/d4860dc0af0af210.png\" alt=\"Five graphs are titled graph S, graph T, graph U, graph V, and graph W. Graph S has five vertices: a, b, c, d, and e. The edges connect a b, a c, b c, c d, c e, and d e. Graph T has four vertices: a, b, d, and e. The edges connect a b, a e, b d, and d e. Graph U has 6 vertices: a, b, f, c, d, and e. The vertices connect a b, a f, f d, b c, c d, d e, c e, and a c. Graph V has four vertices: a, b, d, and e. The edges connect a b, a d, a e, b d, and d e. Graph W has four vertices: a, b, d, and e. The edges connect a b, a d, and d e.\">\n",
